  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Fixed action rule and fallback",
      "items": [
        "Original row-ID parity defines folds. Fit only original QQ on each population; conditional recovered pose gives E=[unit(t)]xR and F=K1^-T E K0^-1.",
        "Each row minimizes processed-pixel Sampson squared over actual QQ, PP, PQ, QP; baseline QQ wins ties. No new coordinates, clipping or row deletion.",
        "Both opposite folds require N>=5 and successful finite proper pose/nonzero translation. Either unsupported fold makes C and shuffle exact whole-pair QQ. Full-fit in-sample fallback is independent."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Eight arms; four declared controls",
      "items": [
        "B, crossfold C, full-fit in-sample, action-count shuffle, raw PP, endpoint half, native STAR, sparse stock Small. All action arms retain every acquired row.",
        "Raw PP and native STAR emit identical coordinates; stock keeps its original sparse population. Separate unseeded GC variation on equal inputs is not an action effect.",
        "All/even/odd references are fitted once per pair and held fixed across ten final draws. Original8 smoke includes forced unscored recovery witnesses."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Qualification and limits",
      "items": [
        "Original8 smoke then exposed MD32 pilot (sixteen pairs per scene). Per-panel fresh prepasses: total2744 GC before any full stage; no speed claim.",
        "Gate: C-B>=0.5 AUC5, both scenes positive, beat all four declared controls, >=8/10 positive draws, no failure/severe rise, genuine change and complete validity.",
        "Known geometry adaptation; novelty unestablished. Cross-fitting removes direct same-row fit inclusion, not wrong consensus or pair dependence. No FINAL, student training or accepted gain is implied."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Local ownership and source status",
      "items": [
        "Parent snapshots sources before checks and owns one stable heavy lock, per-panel global seals and positive process/group/FD closure. Fresh neural prepass, GC, pose, action, score and audit workers run serially.",
        "Same local CPU host: CPU4, inclusive RSS8GiB, actual retention forecast and existing disk liabilities/floor. No cumulative-hour gate or deployment change.",
        "Everything tagged PROPOSED is unimplemented RM053 work. Citations bind retained RM051/native and RM042 seams at the historical scientific checkpoint; they do not assert RM053 execution."
      ]
    }
  ]
